{"t":"006360.KS","n":"GS Engineering & Construction Corporation","nKo":"GS건설","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":25900.0,"chg":850.0,"chgPct":0.03393,"prev":25050.0,"dayH":26450.0,"dayL":25350.0,"w52H":44850.0,"w52L":18220.0,"vol":1178020,"avgVol":1147234,"mcap":2198622437376,"pe":null,"fpe":5.9,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":500.0,"divY":0.02,"beta":0.94,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Industrials","sKo":"산업재","i":"Engineering & Construction","iKo":"엔지니어링 및 건설","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.gsenc.com","sum":"GS Engineering & Construction Corporation engages in the civil works and construction, sales of new houses, repairs and maintenance, overseas general construction, and technology consultation activities in South Korea and internationally. The company operates through Architectural & Housing Construction, Development & New Business, Plant Construction, Infra Works, Prefab, Inima, and Others segments. The Architectural & Housing Construction segment builds and markets office building, factory, apartment and others. The Development & New Business engages in overseas development projects. The Plant Construction segment constructs petroleum refineries, power plants, and others. The Infra Works segment constructs roads, railways, power control facility, water reservoirs, ports, industrial parks,","sumKo":"GS건설은 국내외 토목공사, 신축주택 매매, 유지보수, 해외 종합건설, 기술상담 등의 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 건축 및 주택 건설, 개발 및 신규 사업, 플랜트 건설, 인프라 작업, 조립식, Inima 및 기타 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 건축 및 주택 건설 부문은 사무실 건물, 공장, 아파트 등을 건설하고 판매합니다. 개발신사업은 해외개발사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 플랜트 건설 부문은 석유 정제소, 발전소 등을 건설합니다. Infra Works 부문은 도로, 철도, 전력 제어 시설, 저수지, 항만, 산업 단지,"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":12298622000000,"ni":342918000000},{"y":2023,"rev":13436627000000,"ni":-481829000000},{"y":2024,"rev":12863812000000,"ni":246593000000},{"y":2025,"rev":12450431000000,"ni":93552000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":2983471000000,"ni":37959000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":